OL,3,GNEWSAScottish airport numbers soar
OL,4,Adespite Middle East turmoil
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of passengers passing
OL,7,Fthrough Scotland's airports rose
OL,8,Fsharply in the spring, largely driven
OL,9,Fby budget airlines.
OL,11,FDespite the disruption caused by the
OL,12,Fwar in the Middle East, almost 300,000
OL,13,Fextra travellers took flights compared
OL,14,Fto the same period last year, a 4%
OL,15,Fincrease.
OL,17,FState-owned Prestwick Airport was also
OL,18,Fparticularly busy with freight flights,
OL,19,Fseeing a near three-fold year-on-year
OL,20,Fincrease in cargo volumes.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
