OL,3,GNEWSAScottish airport numbers soar
OL,4,Adespite Middle East turmoil
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmsterdam, Dublin and Palma de Mallorca
OL,7,Fwere the most popular passenger
OL,8,Fdestinations, followed by Alicante,
OL,9,FMalaga and Paris.
